invariant: INV-14
file: srv.c
catches: srv_auth_test
reason: a server takes a cookie_key of all zero bytes, the bytes a static
  array holds until something fills it, so anyone mints the cookies of
  its HelloRetryRequest. test/srv_identity_tests.h's zero cookie_key rows
  require CH_EINVAL before any I/O.

--- old
    if (srv->cookie_key == NULL || ct_memeq(srv->cookie_key, unfilled_key, sizeof unfilled_key)) {
--- new
    if (srv->cookie_key == NULL) {
